  "notes": "The portable C++ scenario uses only the official IEEE 1516.1 API and standard library. A requester issues a regular attribute-ownership acquisition, the owner receives the standard assumption callback, and the requester resigns with CANCEL_PENDING_OWNERSHIP_ACQUISITIONS. The owner remains the owner; after it divests, a different joined federate acquires the attribute, checking that the resigned request did not leave stale acquisition state.",
